description:
ASUS TUF A18 gaming laptop features the 18inch FHD+ G-SYNC display with narrow bezel design for crisp, true-to-life colors; While the 144Hz refresh rate features adaptive sync to minimize screen tearing for smooth, crisp visuals and seamless gameplay;

ASUS gaming laptop 18inch backed by the dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 Graphics enable better performance for gamers and creators by reducing latency and increasing frame rates;

ASUS TUF gaming Laptop powered by 8-core AMD Ryzen 7 260 Beat i9-13905H Processor for heavy PC games and video-editing applications smoothly;

ASUS TUF gaming laptop with rgb keyboard which is excellent support in competitive gaming that increases real-time performance;

Stay cool through the improved thermals cooling technology, multiple venting and airflow ensure optimal system stability and performance when gameplay heats up.

AI noise-canceling technology;
DTS software;
Support near field/Far field;
Built-in array microphone;
2-speaker system

1x USB 3.2 Gen 2 Type-C (Support data transfer, DisplayPort, Power delivery);
1x Type-C USB 4 with support for DisplayPort;
1x USB 2.0 Type-A;
2x USB 3.2 Gen 2 Type-A;
1x RJ45 LAN port
